# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# research-notebook — ignore rules
#
# Belt and braces, and the first of the three layers that live in this
# repository: this file, then .githooks/pre-commit, then the required check in
# .github/workflows/copyright.yml. Anything arriving by the promotion path has
# already been refused once by the tool in the private workspace, which runs
# before a file is written here and cannot be inspected from here; these lines
# are what catches a file added by hand instead.
#
# The trade: anyone can edit this file, and git ignores nothing that is already
# tracked. So the two layers behind it do not trust it, and the checker reads
# the first bytes of a file as well as its name.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- the copyright boundary ------------------------------------------------
# No PDF, ever, anywhere, in any letter case.
#
# Two things changed after an adversarial audit of this boundary. The pattern
# is case-insensitive because `*.pdf` on a Linux runner let `paper.PDF` walk
# straight through. And the old negation for assets/figures/ is gone: a
# publisher PDF renamed into that directory beside an empty .source.yml passed
# every layer. Figures here are .svg or .png; a PDF figure is not a thing this
# repository has, so the exemption bought nothing and cost the boundary.
*.[pP][dD][fF]

# ---- private material that must never cross ---------------------------------
**/private/
*-draft.md
*.local.md
.leakwords
rw.local.json

# ---- datasets and weights ---------------------------------------------------
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.npz
*.parquet
*.dcm
*.nii
*.nii.gz
data/
runs/
checkpoints/
wandb/

# ---- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---- site build -------------------------------------------------------------
site/
.cache/
.lycheecache

# ---- OS and editor ----------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
